>	1)	How do I use (or what good are) Book of the Dead, candelabrum
>		or the Bell of Opening?

Go as deep in Gehennom as you can. There will be a level (usually somewhere
around 54-55) where you can find no more stairs down, but instead you feel
strange vibrations under your feet in one square. On this square, attach 7 
candles to the candelabrum (apply them), light the candles (apply Candelabrum),
ring the bell and read the Book of Dead. If you do it in the right order and
none of the artifacts mentioned are cursed, you'll definitely know what to
do after that..

>	2)	After Fort Ludios, Vlad's Tower, Hell (to level 50), 
>		Gnomish mines, Quest, Dungeons of Doom are there any 
>		other places to go?

Sanctum. That's where you'll go after you've done what I described in the
answer to the previous question. There, on the left side of the screen, is
a temple where the High Priest of Moloch guards The Amulet of Yendor.
You'll have to do some searching to find the secret door to the temple.
Grab the Amulet and get the Gehennom out of there. Above dungeonlevel 1
there are the endgame levels which you still have to go through before you
can give the Amulet to your god.

